          </p>
</div>
<!-- Metric Highlight Badge Bento -->
<div class="flex sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-4 shrink-0">
<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-xs flex items-center gap-4 min-w-[240px]">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">shield_with_heart</span>
</div>
<div>
<div class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-bold">Rp 65 Miliar</div>
